 # Student Record System - SIWES Project

    A simple web-based Student Record System built with JSP, Servlets, and MySQL.

    ## Features
    - Add new student records
    - View all student records
    - Connected to MySQL database

    ## Technologies Used
    - Java JSP & Servlets
    - MySQL Database
    - HTML/CSS
    - Apache Tomcat Server

    ## How to Run
    1. Create database `studentdb` in MySQL
    2. Run the SQL script in `database.sql`
    3. Update DB username/password in `DBConnection.java`
    4. Deploy project to Apache Tomcat
    5. Access: `http://localhost:8080/StudentRecordSystem/`

    ## Project Structure
    - `index.jsp` - Home page
    - `addStudent.jsp` - Form to add student
    - `viewStudents.jsp` - Display all students
    - `DBConnection.java` - Database connection
    - `Student.java` - Student model
    - `AddStudentServlet.java` - Handles adding students
    - `ViewStudentsServlet.java` - Handles viewing students
